  "metadata": {
    "title": "Self-Playing Neural Rack",
    "author": "groovy",
    "description": "Clock/S&H/Quantizer rack: Osc is the DSP voice; AutomationToMIDI feeds ACE-Step as an oscillator; RAVE is the filter. Layers freeze on an object bus through FOA. Install ace-step-1.5 + rave-v1 (CC-BY-NC). Offline \u00b7 Play = cached PCM.",
