      "id": "n0",
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "widgets": {
        "text": "Self-Playing Neural Rack \u2014 Clock\u2192S&H\u2192Quantizer chooses pitch. Osc = DSP voice. AutomationToMIDI \u2192 ACE-Step (AI oscillator). RAVE = neural filter. Object bus \u2192 FOA freeze. RAVE is CC-BY-NC. Offline sample-accurate render \u00b7 Play = cached PCM."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "Clock",
      "pos": { "x": 0, "y": 160 },
      "widgets": {
        "bpm": 96.0,
        "pulse_ms": 110.0,
        "duration_sec": 10.0,
        "sample_rate": 48000
      }
    },
    {
